### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8086/api/dormitory
@roomId = <replace_with_actual_room_id>
@studentId = <replace_with_actual_student_id>
@assignmentId = <replace_with_actual_assignment_id>

### -----------------------------------------------------
### Room Management
### -----------------------------------------------------

### 1. Add a new room
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomNumber": "101A",
  "building": "North Hall",
  "capacity": 2,
  "amenities": [
    "Wi-Fi",
    "Air Conditioning",
    "Private Bathroom"
  ]
}

###

### 2. Retrieve all rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms

###

### 3. Retrieve specific room details
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}

###

### 4. Check room availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/availability

###

### -----------------------------------------------------
### Student Assignments
### -----------------------------------------------------

### 5. Check student eligibility for housing
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/eligibility

###

### 6. Assign a student to a room
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "semester": "Fall 2026"
}

###

### 7. Get current room assignment for a specific student
GET {{baseUrl}}/assignments/student/{{studentId}}

###

### 8. Remove a student's room assignment (Move-out/Cancel)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
